	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg27412"></a>
		<table width="100%" cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0" style="table-layout: fixed;">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="16%" rowspan="2" style="overflow: hidden;">
							<b><a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?action=profile;u=13" title="View the profile of maharlika">maharlika</a></b>
							<div class="smalltext">
								Sr. Member<br />
								<img src="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/Themes/safgrey105/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/Themes/safgrey105/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/Themes/safgrey105/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/Themes/safgrey105/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 290<br />
								<br />
								<div style="overflow: auto; width: 100%;"><img src="http://www.hawaii.edu/cps/bonifacio.jpg" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /></div><br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?action=profile;u=13"><img src="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/Themes/safgrey105/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</div>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?topic=2209.msg27412#msg27412"><img src="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/Themes/safgrey105/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?topic=2209.msg27412#msg27412">Re: (Rich) White People and Blue Scholars</a></b>
									<div class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #1 on:</b> May 16, 2007, 10:36:42 am &#187;</div></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div style="overflow: auto; width: 100%;">when dead prez was here last year, M1 did a talk at Garfield high school that i got the chance to check out...<br /><br />although he recognizes how the commodification of hip hop (with the bulk of sales from white suburban kids who can afford it) is occuring he said that what he&#039;ll remember from Seattle won&#039;t be the show but the free talks he gives to young poor people of color in the high schools....<br /><br />if rich white kids are the only ones with the money to buy lots of shirts and CDs, then cool, cuz it allows artists to bring their message for free to the folks that the songs are about or to....<br /><br />i have seen massline artists do free shows for several local organizations, sometimes at times when there&#039;s only 20 ppl in the audience but what&#039;s key are that those 20 are the future leaders of a movement made up of oppressed communities rising up.  while sold out shows at the showbox helps pay the mortgage, it allows them to work with the communities that the music speaks for and to...<br /><br />that&#039;s how i think about it....</div>
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext" width="85%">
