									<img src="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/Themes/safgrey105/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" />
									Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div style="overflow: auto; width: 100%; padding-bottom: 3px;" class="signature">&quot;A way of life based off the common need,<br />And all my comrades is ready, <br />we just spreadin the seed&quot; - dead prez</div>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg27413"></a>
		<table width="100%" cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0" style="table-layout: fixed;">
